              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mur’ iyo misi Hezekiya ararwara agera hafi yo gupfa. Bukeye ūvugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amosi aza kuri we, aramubgira, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo Tunganya ivyo mu rugo rwawe, kuk’ ugira utange, utagikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Hezekiya ahindukiriza amaso ku rusika, asenga Uhoraho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.18.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 18:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 5:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.39.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 39:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.39.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Tegēra, Uhoraho we, ni wibuke ingene nagendera mu vy’ukuri imbere yawe n’umutima utunganye, ngakora ivyo ubona kw ari vyiza. Hezekiya ararira cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yesaya atararēngāna ngw ave mu nyubakwa, ijambo ry’Uhoraho riza kuri we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 9:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.56.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 56:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Subira inyuma, ubarire Hezekiya segaba w’abantu banje, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho, Imana ya sogokuruza Dawidi, agize: uti Ngo Yumvise ugusenga kwawe, abonye n’amosozi yawe; ut’ Eh’ azogukiza; uti Maze ku musi ugira gatatu uzodūga uje mu ngoro yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.19.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 19:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uti Kandi ku misi yawe yongeyekw imyaka cumi n’itanu. Uti Kand’ azokurokorana n’iki gisagara, agukūre mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri; uti Kand’ azozigama iki gisagara kubgiwe, no kubg’ umusavyi wiwe Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yesaya aravuga, ati Muzane intore ibumbabumbge mu nsukoni. Bayizanye bayomeka ku kivyimba, arakira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya abaza Yesaya, at’ Ikimenyamenya kizoba iki, cerekana k’Uhoraho azonkiza, kandi ko nzodūga nkaja mu ngoro y’ Uhoraho ku musi ugira gatatu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.19.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 19:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesaya aramwishura, at’ Iki ni co kimenyamenya Uhoraho aguhaye, cemeza yukw azoshitsa ico avuze: uragomba kw igitūtu kija imbere intambuko cumi, canke ko gisubira inyuma intambuko cumi nyene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 6:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.102.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 102:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya aramwishura, at’ Ereg’ igitūtu kuja imbere intambuko cumi n’icoroshe; copfuma gisubira inyuma intambuko cumi nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo muvugishwa Yesaya atakambira Uhoraho; na we ahēra ah’ igitūtu cari kigeze ku ntambuko z’urugero rwashinzwe na Ahazi, asubiza ico gitūtu inyuma intambuko cumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
