          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe Merodaki‐Baladani mwene Baladani umwami w’i Babuloni arungikira Hezekiya ivyete n’ingemurano, kuko yari yumvise ko yarwaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abātumwe Hezekiya abākīra neza, abereka hose mu nzu ah’ abīka ibintu vyiwe vy’igiciro, amafeza n’amazahabu n’imibavu n’amavuta y’igiciro kinini, no mu nzu ah’ abīka ivyo kurwanisha, n’ikintu cose co mu vyo atunze cariho. Nta kintu na kimwe co mu ngoro yiwe canke co mu gihugu ciwe cose Hezekiya atāberetse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye haza uwavugishwa n’ Imana Yesaya ku mwami Hezekiya, aramubaza, at’ Abo bantu bavuze iki, kandi baje i wawe bavuye hehe? Hezekiya aramwishura, ati Baje bavuye mu gihugu ca kure i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arongera aramubaza, ati Babonye ibiki mu ngoro yawe? Hezekiya aramwishura, at’ Ibiri mu ngoro yanje vyose bābibonye: nta kintu na kimwe co mu vyo ntunze ntāberetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
