          "text": "Nukw ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Hezekiya, n’ivy’ ubuhizi bgiwe bgose, n’ingene yimvye ikidengeri, agaca umugende wo kuzana amazi mu gisagara, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? ",
